# Environment Variables — LiquidVotes Frontend

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in real values. **Never commit `.env.local`.**

```env
# ─── Backend API ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Base URL of the LiquidVotes backend (see awards-platform-backend/README.md).
# Defaults to http://localhost:4000 if unset.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000

# ─── App ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_NAME=LiquidVotes
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ─── Supabase (image uploads only, proxied through the backend) ─
# Only needed if the frontend itself talks to Supabase for assets.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_ANON_KEY

# ─── Paystack (public key for client-side checkout) ─────────────
NEXT_PUBLIC_PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
```
